      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any products to be used in clinical trials and any approved product that we may commercialize will need to be manufactured in facilities, and by processes, that comply with the FDA’s cGMP requirements and comparable requirements of the regulatory agencies of other jurisdictions in which we are seeking approval.",
        "start_character": 117865,
        "end_character": 118177
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the regulatory exclusivity period afforded by the 505(b)(2) pathway, we are also constructing an extensive intellectual property portfolio designed to protect the innovations of VDPHL01.",
        "start_character": 110069,
        "end_character": 110270
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity can be reduced or eliminated if competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 112908,
        "end_character": 113166
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also aware of other product candidates in clinical development, including: KX-826, a topical androgen receptor antagonist by Kintor Pharmaceutical Limited, PP405, a topical mitochondrial pyruvate carrier inhibitor by Pelage Pharmaceuticals, Inc., TDM-105795, topical thyromimetic by TechnoDerma Medicines Inc.",
        "start_character": 114385,
        "end_character": 114701
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently rely and expect to continue to rely on third-party contract manufacturing organizations, or CMOs, for the manufacture of our clinical supply requirements, including drug substances and drug products, and label and packaging for our clinical trials, as well as for commercial production of any product candidates that are approved.",
        "start_character": 117018,
        "end_character": 117361
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In anticipation of a potential NDA submission for VDPHL01 leveraging data from our registration-directed Phase 3 trials, we are developing a comprehensive multi-channel commercialization plan that will integrate patient identification, physician education, DTC, advertising, social media and telehealth engagement and customer care.",
        "start_character": 11014,
        "end_character": 11346
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001827635-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001827635-26-000013-5b09cca434d920ae",
        "accession_number": "0001827635-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These patients could be engaged through DTC advertising, social media engagement and physician education initiatives, though we believe meaningful penetration of this segment could develop over extended time periods as awareness builds and VDPHL01, if approved, establishes clinical reputation.",
